  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration and reconstruction of homes (roof repairs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early recovery roof-rebuilding projects are supporting the resilience of people to remain in relatively safe areas and to rebuild their livelihoods. They also contribute to the local economy and encourage the return of refugees and IDPs. Other activities include an upgrade of collective shelters for IDP, a social dormitory for vulnerable people and repairs to make public buildings -youth centre and a secondary school- accessible and functional again.</narrative>
  </description>
